- Water vapor is probably

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:12.453
the most prevalent greenhouse gas.

00:03:12.453 --> 00:03:13.740
- [Neil] In our atmosphere, correct.

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:14.610
There's more water vapor
than anything else.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.770
- [Chuck] Anything else, right.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.580
- If you get all the CO2

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.750
that we have found in the polar ice caps,

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.130
because it's like dry ice there.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.749
'Cause dry ice on Earth is CO2, okay?

00:03:23.749 --> 00:03:27.440
So you get all that evaporated,

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.430
then get all the water, evaporate that,

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.370
it's still not enough
to make a big difference

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:35.070
in the greenhouse trapping of Mars.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:35.950
- Oh, wow!

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:40.950
- So, if we wanna warm the
planet, you gotta B-Y-O.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.300
